I believe this code can be dramatically simplified, but since I am leaving for useR soon I don't have time to explain. In the meantime I think an easy fix is to set outputOptions(session, xxx, suspendWhenHidden=FALSE) for each of your renderUI outputs. I think the problem is that those select inputs don't actually exist at the time that you try to update them (note that outputs, including renderUI outputs, don't run if they're not visible).

