Just found a link solve the problem, in case someone shall need it:
http://neurochem.sisbio.recerca.upc.edu/?p=276

With tiny modification on the code underneath:

for(i in 1:nlevels(Y)) {
y <- levels(Y)[i]
ind <- which(Y == y)
dat[ind, c(1, i+1)] <- mod$x[ind, pc]
}

should be:
for(i in 1:nlevels(Y)) {
y <- levels(Y)[i]
ind <- which(Y == y)
dat[ind, c(1, i+1)] <- mod$x[ind, ]
}

And I think package of "pls" is not in use.

